===Etymology===
From {{etyl|bat-pro|lv}} {{m|ine-bsl-pro|*ledús}}, from {{etyl|ine-pro|lv}} {{m|ine-pro|*ledʰ-||ice}}, perhaps the same as {{m|ine-pro|*leydʰ-||slippery, to slide}}. Cognates include {{cog|lt|lẽdas}}, dialectal {{m|lt|ledùs}}, {{cog|prg|ladis}}, {{cog|ltg|lads}}, {{cog|ru|лёд}}, {{cog|cu|ледъ}}, {{cog|cs|led}}, {{cog|pl|lód}}.<ref>{{R:lv:LEV}}</ref>

